{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Mr. Pompy's Extravagant Quiz! The only quiz to outbeat your brain!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Extravagant Quiz!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Mr. Pompy's Extravagant Quiz, a narrative horror experience taking place in an early 2000s edutainment computer game. Your mission: solve Mr. Pompy's quizzes to recover the lost golden light bulbs, all while he attempts to speak to you beyond the screen. <strong>This is a tech demo, with the full game coming soon!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How It Started</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations! You're among the few people who received our unique cereal box copies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>*NOTE: Any future giveaways of this game are to be discontinued indefinitely. Any customers to get their hands on a copy are considered a lost cause.</i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/a0836ca3a4278f2cb7b828445dbac882.poster.avif?t=1759553811\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/a0836ca3a4278f2cb7b828445dbac882.webm?t=1759553811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Crew! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've got PomPom!</strong> Her lively and boisterous personality can help you solve math problems and, all in all, lift your mood. Visit her store occasionally to purchase several treats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/0122d08d80086ea68e47c30b51151bdd.avif?t=1759553811\" width=393 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next is Patrick!</strong> He will speed you through all you need to know about history and science. Perhaps even to the extent where you greatly surpass him. Visit his library whenever you have some free time to learn about interesting topics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/85e9311d005efda2088f3d5d8ab75d50.avif?t=1759553811\" width=393 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finally, we have Mr. Pompy himself!</strong> As your host, he will ensure that you win the game with nothing less than  perfection and a more positive attitude towards life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/6d11ef2478dbcf2b113baff4292801ad.poster.avif?t=1759553811\" width=392 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/6d11ef2478dbcf2b113baff4292801ad.webm?t=1759553811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/6d11ef2478dbcf2b113baff4292801ad.mp4?t=1759553811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles &amp; Quizzes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do puzzles to proceed to the quiz! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/8aa4a04a05c0f1fc9084dd2f519cadc5.poster.avif?t=1759553811\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998260/extras/8aa4a04a05c0f1fc9084dd2f519cadc5.webm?t=1759553811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea